--- !u!114 &6237117671287542139
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 9222691059785305129}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f5db8044e9b9c1d4f9317de15b5c26ed, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WinConDept
  hoverColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
  hoverText: 
  type: 1
  enforceWrongTags: 1
  enforceAllTags: 0
  hasInfinate: 0
  wantedTags:
  - _name: Andro
    _canHaveMultiple: 0
    _count: 0
  - _name: Bat
    _canHaveMultiple: 0
    _count: 0
  - _name: Craig
    _canHaveMultiple: 0
    _count: 0
  - _name: Miku
    _canHaveMultiple: 0
    _count: 0
  - _name: Nurse
    _canHaveMultiple: 0
    _count: 0
  - _name: SadVampire
    _canHaveMultiple: 0
    _count: 0
  giveTags: []
  itemDisplayPlatform: {fileID: 0}
  heldObject: {fileID: 0}
  timeToProscess: 0
  text:
  - 'Hey! It''s you! '
  - "Welcome to your shift at the monster mixer! I am Salem, the bar\u2019s favorite
    and only cat"
  - "Since this is your first time here at the mixer I\u2019ll go over the things
    to keep in mind when making drinks for our patrons. "
  - Over here to your left is the bar stand. That is where you will be mixing your
    drinks for customers.
  - 'Each type of ingredient has a colour code, <color="red"> Blood is Red, <color="blue">  
    Alcohol is Blue, <color=#00FFFF> Glasses are Cyan, <color="yellow"> Lemons are
    yellow, <color="green"> and Limes are Green. '
  - 'Keep an eye on patrons when they are ordering their drinks. '
  - These colours may come up to help you discern what your patrons are looking for.
  - 'All you need to do is grab the ingredients and place them on middle cutting
    board. '
  - 'This will mix the drink for you! Once you''re done mixing you can give that
    drink to the customer!  '
  - '... '
  - Before you get started for your shift there's a couple of tips I would like to
    share with you.
  - Press R/Shift to pull up your recipe card.
  - 'This may help you make drinks that you may not have heard of before.  '
  - 'Keep in mind that these recipes<color="red">  DO NOT INCLUDE<color="black"> 
    a customer''s blood type preference. That is something you will have to remember
    yourself. '
  - 'The order of what ingredient goes into a drink does not matter currently. The
    magic cutting board does all the work! '
  - If you satisfy a patron 100%, they may give you an offering of gratitude!
  - That's just a rumor though. I would love to get my hands on a customer offering
    ; )
  - 'That''s all for now! Get started making those drinks and don''t forget the <color=#00FFFF>
    Glass <color="black">! '
  - 'That''s all for now! Get started making those drinks and don''t forget the <color=#00FFF>
    Glass <color="white">! '
  rewardDialouge:
  - 'OMG you got one! That means the rumors are true!! Keep up the good work! '
  - 'You got another! If you keep with up we will be out of here in no time! '
  - 'That''s 3! We''re halfway there! Keep it going! '
  - 'Wow I can''t believe you got 4 the end looks like it''s just around the corner! '
  - 'We can almost go home with this 5th plushie! Keep er'' going! '
  - This is it! Time to clock out and go home!
